    "3. Class Schedule （Sample） | Tohoku University\n3. Class Schedule （Sample）\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nJYPE\n>\n3. Class Schedule （Sample）\nSample Study Schedule  (\nPDF\n)\nFall Semester\n(IRT A/Science Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nTuesday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nWednesday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nOrganic Chemistry\nNot taking class\nThursday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nFriday\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIntroductory Quantum Mechanics\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\n(IRT A/Engineering Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nTuesday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nWednesday\nIRT A\nIRT A\nJapanese Culture C\nNot taking class\nIRT A\nThursday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nFriday\nIRT A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nBasic Computer Science\nIRT A\n(IRT A/Agriculture Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nIRT A\nIRT A\nNot taking class\nTuesday\nAgricultural Sciences\nAquatic Plant Ecology\nIRT A\nIRT A\nNot taking class\nWednesday\nNot taking class\nJapanese Culture A\nIRT A\nIRT A\nNot taking class\nThursday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nIRT A\nIRT A\nNot taking class\nFriday\nNot taking class\nIntroduction to Fisheries Science\nIRT A\nIRT A\nNot taking class\n<Fall Semester>\n[Individual Research Training A (IRT A)]: can be scheduled any free periods to make it total 10 classes per week\n[Individual Research Training Senior A (IRT Senior A)]: can be scheduled any free periods to make it total 20 classes per week\nSpring Semester\n(IRT Senior B/Science Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nTuesday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nWednesday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nChemical and Biomolecular Engineering II\nJapanese Culture B\nNot taking class\nThursday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nFriday\nNot taking class\nMolecular and Cellular Biology\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\n(IRT Senior B/Engineering Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nTuesday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nWednesday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nThursday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nFriday\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\nIRT Senior B\n(IRT B/Agriculture Student)\nI. 8:50-10:20\nII. 10:30-12:00\nIII. 13:00-14:30\nIV. 14:40-16:10\nV. 16:20-17:50\nMonday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nIRT B\nIRT B\nNot taking class\nTuesday\nIRT B\nIRT B\nIRT B\nIRT B\nNot taking class\nWednesday\nJapanese 2\nJapanese 2\nChemical and Biomolecular Engineering II\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nThursday\nNot taking class\nNot taking class\nIRT B\nIRT B\nNot taking class\nFriday\nNot taking class\nMolecular and Cellular Biology\nIRT B\nIRT B\nNot taking class\n<Spring Semester>\n[Individual Research Training B (IRT B)]: can be scheduled any free periods to make it total 10 classes per week\n[Individual Research Training Senior B (IRT Senior B)]: can be scheduled any free periods to make it total 20 classes per week\nThese are the samples from JYPE students in the past.\nFor optional courses, students may audit regular courses by permission of the instructor. However, students should not expect any special treatment in such courses.\nMore details will be given during the program orientation."
